# P6.1.3 — tests never run in a runtime image. They are dead weight, they widen the
# disclosure surface, and one of them (test_observability.py) contains a fake `gsk_...`
# literal that trips every secret scanner — noise that erodes trust in real findings.
# Safe to exclude: the wheels build from src/ only (hatch `packages = ["src/..."]`), and
# `uv sync` needs pyproject + lock, never tests.
**/tests/
**/tests
